  },
  "execution": {
    "order": [
      "Process capture_queue strictly by queue_rank.",
      "Download only the exact RealSense ZIP member through the single guarded downloader and verify outer local header, method, member name, compressed bytes, uncompressed bytes, CRC32 and local SHA-256.",
      "Run the bound metadata-only post-download timegrid gate before any depth-value decode or geometry formula execution. The gate verifies the exact capture, Vicon probe decision and actual Vicon bag SHA-256, anchors on the first positive source-native depth timestamp inside the Vicon pose overlap, and fixes every source-consecutive depth pair before CameraInfo or geometry evaluability is considered.",
      "If zero unchanged fixed windows pass, record capture-local TIMEGRID_NOT_EVALUABLE, delete the re-downloadable RealSense member when authorized, and continue to the next locked capture.",
      "If timegrid passes, run the bound geometry-only extractor and pass the exact timegrid receipt to the unchanged fixed-window runner. The runner must verify capture, RealSense bag, Vicon bag, materialized raw-depth SHA-256 and extrinsic SHA-256 identities, reuse the identical anchor and fixed denominator, and execute only timegrid_pass=true windows.",
      "Combine any new positive window only with the already bound DLR below-reference window. Cross-source pooling is forbidden.",
      "Stop the queue immediately after the DLR source role tuple is complete; an unneeded later locked payload is not downloaded.",
      "If the locked prefix ends without a positive window, record SOURCE_LOCK_WAVE_INCOMPLETE; do not reject the unconsumed DLR registry."
    ],
    "tf_filter": "Within the publisher Vicon /tf connection, only parent art0 and child realsense_gt_1 are decoded as pose coordinates. Other TF frame pairs are excluded by header identity before coordinate access.",
    "rgb_policy": "Do not open, deserialize, materialize, decode, render, inspect or use any color topic or bytes. Transient container decompression of nonselected records is immediately discarded.",
    "cleanup_authority": "User authorized deletion of re-downloadable failed or terminal payload while retaining identities, hashes, manifests, ledgers, results and cleanup receipts."
  },
